I wake up in the morning.
Cold air is coming in through the window.
It rained a lot in Mumbai last night.
Mumbai's heat has finally reduced a bit.
But I am not feeling well at all today.
My whole body is aching.
I slowly get up from the bed.
My head has become very heavy.
And my head is aching a lot.
My nose is also completely blocked.
I go to the kitchen.
I take water in a glass and drink it.
My throat is also hurting a lot.
I have fallen sick right at the beginning of the rainy season.
I cannot go to the office today.
I think I should just rest at home today.
I should call the clinic now.
